@startuml

actor User
box "Mobile Device"
participant "Digital Dirham\nMobile App" as App
participant "UAE PASS\nMobile App" as UAEApp
end box

box "UAE PASS" #lightgreen
participant "UAE PASS\n<auth server>" as UAEPass
end box

box "LFI" #LightYellow
participant "LFI Identity Broker\n(Keycloak)" as LFIKeycloak
participant "LFI Mobile Back End" as Backend
end box

box "CB" #LightBlue
participant "CB APP \n<OAUTH CLIENT>" as CBAPP
end box
autonumber 


User -> App : Select LFI login
App -> LFIKeycloak : Auth request
LFIKeycloak -> User : Prompt for credentials
LFIKeycloak -> App : Redirect with deep link to UAE PASS
User -> UAEApp : Enter credentials
UAEApp -> UAEPass : Authenticate to UAEPASS
note across:  How to redirection works (need whitelisting) this step is an abstraction of a redirect frmo the mobile
UAEPass --> LFIKeycloak: Return UAE PASS auth code

alt "LFI Keycloak as UAE PASS OAuth client"
note over LFIKeycloak, CBAPP: same flow for shared Auth client across LFIs
LFIKeycloak -[#red]-> UAEPass: Request Authentication Token
UAEPass -[#red]-> LFIKeycloak: Return ID Token \n+ Access Token (derives UUID)
else "via CB APP as unique OAuth client"
note over LFIKeycloak, CBAPP: Custom SPI or federation
LFIKeycloak --> CBAPP: Forwards UAEPASS auth code
CBAPP --> UAEPass: Request UAEPASS auth token
UAEPass --> CBAPP: Return UAEPASS auth token
CBAPP --> LFIKeycloak: Return "success" + UUID
end

LFIKeycloak --> App: Return Keycloak OAUTH tokens + refresh token

App -> Backend: Access wallet feature with Keycloak OAUTH token
Backend --> App: Return wallet data
App -> User: Display Home Screen

@enduml